{"id":"903e38bc688a0a59","group":"17","path":"17/17-thm-model-completeness-substructure-test.md","title":"Substructure Characterization of Model Completeness","display":"thm-model-completeness-substructure-test — Substructure Characterization of Model Completeness","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-thm-model-completeness-substructure-test","aliases":["17-thm-model-completeness-substructure-test"],"display":"thm-model-completeness-substructure-test — Substructure Characterization of Model Completeness","depends_on":["[[17-df-model-completeness]]","[[17-df-model]]","[[17-df-elementary-substructure]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","source_verification":"not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed","legacy_label":"17-thm-3.4.4","local_revision":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-thm-model-completeness-substructure-test"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-thm-model-completeness-substructure-test</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-model-completeness-substructure-test — Substructure Characterization of Model Completeness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"59d623a1692279f1\" href=\"?note=59d623a1692279f1\" title=\"17-df-model-completeness\">17-df-model-completeness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"71ede582cb78a069\" href=\"?note=71ede582cb78a069\" title=\"17-df-elementary-substructure\">17-df-elementary-substructure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-thm-3.4.4"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (theory with model class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ModelComplete}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{ModelComplete}_L\\)</span> (model-completeness predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"59d623a1692279f1\" href=\"?note=59d623a1692279f1\" title=\"17-df-model-completeness\">17-df-model-completeness</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\)</span> (model class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\subseteq_L,\\preceq_L\">\\(\\subseteq_L,\\preceq_L\\)</span> (substructure and elementary-substructure relations, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"71ede582cb78a069\" href=\"?note=71ede582cb78a069\" title=\"17-df-elementary-substructure\">17-df-elementary-substructure</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ModelComplete}_L(T)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathfrak A\\subseteq_L\\mathfrak B\n\\to\n\\mathfrak A\\preceq_L\\mathfrak B\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ModelComplete}_L(T)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathfrak A\\subseteq_L\\mathfrak B\n\\to\n\\mathfrak A\\preceq_L\\mathfrak B\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The hypothesis is structural inclusion <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\subseteq_L\">\\(\\subseteq_L\\)</span>, not mere inclusion of carrier sets.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-model-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"59d623a1692279f1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-model-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"53255a372e5c1ee8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-elementary-substructure","status":"resolved","id":"71ede582cb78a069","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-elementary-substructure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"59d623a1692279f1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ModelComplete}_L$ (model-completeness predicate, see [[17-df-model-completeness]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"53255a372e5c1ee8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt"